WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.441 --> 00:00:03.245
(audience laughing)

00:00:03.245 --> 00:00:08.145
- Thor's Hammer is out
here sitting on the stage.

00:00:08.145 --> 00:00:09.253
What's that all about, Andy?

00:00:09.253 --> 00:00:10.896
- I don't know, I noticed it earlier.

00:00:10.896 --> 00:00:13.543
I just figured you would know what it was.

00:00:13.543 --> 00:00:14.376
- No! I come out here

00:00:14.376 --> 00:00:15.986
and there's Thor's
Hammer just sitting here.

00:00:15.986 --> 00:00:18.020
We can't do a show with
that thing sitting there.

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:19.357
It's stupid, you know?

00:00:19.357 --> 00:00:20.333
It's in the way!

00:00:20.333 --> 00:00:22.850
I'm gonna get rid of it
right, should I get rid of it?

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:25.121
This thing's gotta go!

00:00:25.121 --> 00:00:27.570
(audience cheering)

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:28.820
Should be easy.

00:00:30.426 --> 00:00:32.017
(grunting and straining)

00:00:32.017 --> 00:00:33.851
Come on, man!

00:00:33.851 --> 00:00:35.895
- [Audience] Conan! Conan! Conan!

00:00:35.895 --> 00:00:38.344
Conan! Conan! Conan!

00:00:38.344 --> 00:00:40.713
- I'll give it a try.
- Yeah, try that.

00:00:40.713 --> 00:00:41.978
- [Audience] Andy! Andy! Andy!

00:00:41.978 --> 00:00:43.395
Andy! Andy! Andy!

00:00:44.428 --> 00:00:46.088
- Hey, let's both--
- That was a mistake.

00:00:46.088 --> 00:00:47.319
- Let's both try it together.

00:00:47.319 --> 00:00:48.909
- All right.
- Try it together, okay?

00:00:48.909 --> 00:00:50.488
Let's get in there.

00:00:50.488 --> 00:00:52.404
(audience cheering)

00:00:52.404 --> 00:00:53.635
- We're not gonna do it.

00:00:53.635 --> 00:00:56.444
- I guess neither of us is
worthy, I think that thing's--

00:00:56.444 --> 00:00:59.951
(lightning strikes)

00:00:59.951 --> 00:01:01.588
Wait a minute.

00:01:01.588 --> 00:01:05.255
(dramatic orchestral music)

00:01:06.568 --> 00:01:09.568
(audience cheering)

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:17.621
- What's up dudes? What's going on?

00:01:17.621 --> 00:01:19.699
- Hey, Will Arnett,
what are you doing here?

00:01:19.699 --> 00:01:20.721
What's going on?

00:01:20.721 --> 00:01:22.230
- Not much, I was just dropping by

00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:24.064
and I noticed that I left this here.

00:01:24.064 --> 00:01:25.852
That's so funny, yeah.

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:28.852
(audience cheering)

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:34.873
- Okay, you gotta stop,
stop hamming it up.

00:01:34.873 --> 00:01:35.733
How did you do that?

00:01:35.733 --> 00:01:37.242
How did you do that?

00:01:37.242 --> 00:01:38.496
- What?

00:01:38.496 --> 00:01:40.748
Oh, dude, I'm Thor.

00:01:40.748 --> 00:01:43.070
(audience laughing)

00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:44.533
- You're Thor?

00:01:44.533 --> 00:01:47.484
- Yeah, Conan, everybody knows that.

00:01:47.484 --> 00:01:48.734
I'm Thor and...

00:01:50.373 --> 00:01:51.998
(audience laughing)

00:01:51.998 --> 00:01:53.554
I'm also Lego Batman.

00:01:53.554 --> 00:01:56.554
(audience cheering)

00:02:03.387 --> 00:02:05.083
Check this out. You ready?

00:02:05.083 --> 00:02:06.476
- Uh huh.

00:02:06.476 --> 00:02:07.811
- Lego Batman.

00:02:07.811 --> 00:02:10.811
(audience cheering)

00:02:11.781 --> 00:02:12.966
Thor.

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:15.288
(audience laughing)

00:02:15.288 --> 00:02:16.681
Ready?
- Yeah.

00:02:16.681 --> 00:02:18.271
- Lego Batman.

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:21.000
(audience cheering)

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.625
And now I'm Thor.

00:02:22.625 --> 00:02:24.181
- Yeah, okay, all right.

00:02:24.181 --> 00:02:26.828
That explanation went on way too long.

00:02:26.828 --> 00:02:28.953
(audience laughing)

00:02:28.953 --> 00:02:31.727
- I see why Thor has to overcompensate.

00:02:31.727 --> 00:02:33.481
(everyone laughing loudly)

00:02:33.481 --> 00:02:34.874
- He's an easygoing dude.

00:02:34.874 --> 00:02:36.952
- Yeah, tell us what
brings you to Comic-Con.

00:02:36.952 --> 00:02:38.217
- Dude, are you kidding me?

00:02:38.217 --> 00:02:40.702
Do you know how much tail
Thor gets at Comic-Con?

00:02:40.702 --> 00:02:42.049
It's unreal.

00:02:42.049 --> 00:02:43.848
(audience laughing)

00:02:43.848 --> 00:02:45.482
And you know how much
Lego tail, Lego Batman--

00:02:45.482 --> 00:02:46.997
- Okay, I don't wanna--

00:02:46.997 --> 00:02:48.571
(audience and Andy laughing loudly)

00:02:48.571 --> 00:02:50.199
No one wants to know about that.

00:02:50.199 --> 00:02:51.372
- Yeah, anyway, listen.

00:02:51.372 --> 00:02:53.043
Thanks for keeping her safe,
I really gotta run man.

00:02:53.043 --> 00:02:55.412
I got a date with 20
Harley Quinn's and, uh,

00:02:55.412 --> 00:02:58.802
just kinda wondering
if they can handle it.

00:02:58.802 --> 00:03:02.292
(audience laughing)

00:03:02.292 --> 00:03:04.142
Yeah, I can handle it.

00:03:04.142 --> 00:03:06.882
I mean, I'm BoJack
Horseman for Christ's sake.

00:03:06.882 --> 00:03:08.717
(audience cheering)

00:03:08.717 --> 00:03:11.039
(lightning striking)

00:03:11.039 --> 00:03:14.706
(dramatic orchestral music)

00:03:21.047 --> 00:03:22.219
- Will Arnett, everybody.

00:03:22.219 --> 00:03:24.263
Catch, Will Arnett.

00:03:24.263 --> 00:03:27.346
(audience cheering)

